      "value": "This endpoint was no longer used by the client, and therefore was removed.\n\nAPI endpoints are not intended for third-party usage, although responsible use isn't prohibited. However, as we've stated several times, API functionality may change at any given time with no warning.\n\nThis endpoint will not be re-opened.",
